WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.994
Today we will revise a work thoughtfully. Our work connects with communities across

00:00:04.994 --> 00:00:05.363
Africa.

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.336
Read or listen to one helpful comment on the draft.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:13.123
Choose one change that supports the artwork’s purpose.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:19.525
Make the change and explain how the second version improved. Explain one respectful

00:00:19.525 --> 00:00:22.392
similarity or difference with another African example.
